 or deployment. Original Monitor visual/control qualification, native participant poll/apply/empty ACK, WebSocket and broader project parity remain open.`;\nconst r=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__github_update_pull_request({repository_full_name:\"jurei733/testcenter-rewrite\",pr_number:13,body});text({error:r.isError||false,draft:r.structuredContent?.draft});\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"source /Users/julian/Documents/Codex/toolchains/testcenter-20261028/env.sh\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nimport subprocess\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nbody='''Published head13b55303; PR13 stays draft and blocked. CI40780517464 completed87/90 successfully: participant-detail/current Original booklet-config login and Verona merged-return state failed, followed by aggregate acceptance. All5 Original references and Native Quick passed; no unchanged rerun.\\n\\nUnpublished local follow-upfe4e8823 fixes the three review findings and the recurring timer input-loss cause. Finish-all now gets one fresh complete native snapshot; failed reads send no writes. HTTP/body reads, process supervision and shutdown are bounded. Configured feedback uses its real text key. Form overlays initialize synchronously: recorded trusted5 input previously reached an unbound control, then first Reactive Forms setup overwrote it to10. The final headed Chrome trace keeps5 in input and actual command.\\n\\nLocal checks:2099frontend,65lifecycle/supervision,34headedChrome scenarios (all prior29 retained), typecheck, normal468.75kB under unchanged470kB gate. Old13b fails7/45 regression cases. This follow-up is not pushed or independently reviewed. Two current full-CI failures have downloaded SHA-verified artifacts and require targeted diagnosis before next publication. Public findings are intentionally still open on their actual13b code version.\\n\\nFull functional/visual parity remains open: measured Source Monitor visuals/controls, native participant poll/apply/empty ACK, WebSocket and broad remaining requirements. Original read-only. No approval, merge or deployment.'''\\nr=subprocess.run(['entire','trail','update','8','--body',body,'--json'],capture_output=True,text=True);Path('/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-10-28/lies-users-julian-documents-codex-2026/work/monitor-round4-trail-update.json').write_text(r.stdout+r.stderr);print('trail updated',r.returncode);raise SystemExit(r.returncode)\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-10-20/en/work/testcenter-native-monitor-ui\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:100}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184ae-5246-7630-8618-571a3f580cf8","create_time":1793229615.6090724}}}
