url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jurei733\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"Native Monitor integration remains draft at published head `13b553036716cb67df8f3de9b4ba0fbee5dc9089`, based on mainad92. Current CI40780517464 is terminal:87 successful jobs, two actual failures (participant-detail/current Original booklet-config login and Verona merged-return state), plus the failing aggregate acceptance gate. All five Original reference jobs and Native Quick passed. No unchanged CI rerun.\\n\\nLocal unpublished follow-up `fe4e8823ab2bc3c7d8960d98d3c7c902f68f1e98` fixes the three current findings and the recurring timer input-loss cause:\\n- Finish-all reads one fresh complete native snapshot, independent of rendered rows/material; failed reads cannot write or navigate.\\n- Native smoke HTTP/body reads, owned process supervision and shutdown have fixed deadlines.\\n- Command feedback uses its actual configured text key and replacements.\\n- Zoned-independent form overlays initialize their view synchronously: a captured trusted input had reached an unbound field and was overwritten by first setup. The final trace preserves5 in both input and command.\\n\\nLocal evidence for that follow-up:2,099 frontend checks,65 lifecycle/supervision checks, typecheck, normal468.75kB build under the unchanged470kB hard gate, and34 headed Chrome scenarios pass. All29 prior browser markers remain; old13b fails7/45 regression cases. The follow-up is not pushed or independently reviewed yet. The two complete-CI failures have verified downloaded artifacts and remain open for targeted diagnosis before the next publication.\\n\\nCurrent public local-review findings and Approvals stay blocked at https://entire.com/gh/jurei733/-/trails/8/changes/testcenter-rewrite/8 . No automatic approval, merge or deployment. Original Monitor visual/control qualification, native participant poll/apply/empty ACK, WebSocket and broader project parity remain open.\",\"labels\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T19:40:58Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T07:19:25Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"merge_commit_sha\":\"4d53b3310dd12c3b82393da9dbe7cfe7d96cbdbe\",\"assignee\":null,\"assignees\":[],\"requested_reviewers\":[],\"requested_teams\":[],\"head\":{\"label\":\"jurei733:codex/native-monitor-ui-20261028\",\"ref\":\"codex/native-monitor-ui-20261028\",\"repo\":{\"id\":1220799688,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOSMPsyA\",\"name\":\"testcenter-rewrite\",\"full_name\":\"jurei733/testcenter-rewrite\",\"owner\":{\"login\":\"jurei733\",\"id\":67505990,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTA1OTkw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67505990?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jurei733\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jurei733/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com