lable Controller frame fails before any native input\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9791424Z ok 238 - a missing or unscrollable Controller frame fails before any native input\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9792080Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9792357Z   duration_ms: 0.432827\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9792671Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9792922Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9793533Z # Subtest: a failed native radio check remains a failure without retry, bypass or page advancement\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9794531Z not ok 239 - a failed native radio check remains a failure without retry, bypass or page advancement\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795149Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795451Z   duration_ms: 0.92906\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795798Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9796663Z   location: '/home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:106:1'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9798209Z   failureType: 'testCodeFailure'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9798598Z   error: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9799100Z     The validation function is expected to return \\\"true\\\". Received false\",\"2026-10-29T07:23:03.9792922Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9793533Z # Subtest: a failed native radio check remains a failure without retry, bypass or page advancement\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9794531Z not ok 239 - a failed native radio check remains a failure without retry, bypass or page advancement\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795149Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795451Z   duration_ms: 0.92906\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9795798Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9796663Z   location: '/home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:106:1'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9798209Z   failureType: 'testCodeFailure'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9798598Z   error: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9799100Z     The validation function is expected to return \\\"true\\\". Received false\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9799624Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9799912Z     Caught error:\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9800218Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9800656Z     TypeError: frame.locator(...).evaluate is not a function\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9801151Z   code: 'ERR_ASSERTION'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9801514Z   name: 'AssertionError'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9801847Z   stack: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9802870Z     async TestContext.<anonymous> (file:///home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:109:3)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9803826Z     async Test.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9804786Z     async Test.processPendingSubtests (node:internal/test_runner/test:744:7)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9805358Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9805923Z # Subtest: a failed native page click cannot claim completed presentation\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9806749Z not ok 240 - a failed native page click cannot claim completed presentation\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9807433Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9807739Z   duration_ms: 0.590262\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9808080Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9808965Z   location: '/home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:113:1'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9809871Z   failureType: 'testCodeFailure'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9810265Z   error: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9810748Z     The validation function is expected to return \\\"true\\\". Received false\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811271Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811531Z     Caught error:\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811818Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9812230Z     TypeError: frame.locator(...).evaluate is not a function\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9812709Z   code: 'ERR_ASSERTION'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9813048Z   name: 'AssertionError'\",\"2026-10-29T07:23:03.9805358Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9805923Z # Subtest: a failed native page click cannot claim completed presentation\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9806749Z not ok 240 - a failed native page click cannot claim completed presentation\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9807433Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9807739Z   duration_ms: 0.590262\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9808080Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9808965Z   location: '/home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:113:1'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9809871Z   failureType: 'testCodeFailure'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9810265Z   error: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9810748Z     The validation function is expected to return \\\"true\\\". Received false\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811271Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811531Z     Caught error:\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9811818Z     \\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9812230Z     TypeError: frame.locator(...).evaluate is not a function\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9812709Z   code: 'ERR_ASSERTION'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9813048Z   name: 'AssertionError'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9813366Z   stack: |-\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9814357Z     async TestContext.<anonymous> (file:///home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/controller-player-input.test.mjs:116:3)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9815484Z     async Test.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9816174Z     async Test.processPendingSubtests (node:internal/test_runner/test:744:7)\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9816697Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9817640Z # Subtest: current Original corpus explicitly reads release detail through the main smoke's default-POST adapter\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9818794Z ok 241 - current Original corpus explicitly reads release detail through the main smoke's default-POST adapter\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9819466Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9819747Z   duration_ms: 23.680042\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9820074Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9820346Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9821022Z # Subtest: actual custom-text editors retain empty, whitespace and surrounding text exactly\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9821948Z ok 242 - actual custom-text editors retain empty, whitespace and surrounding text exactly\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9822675Z   ---\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9822910Z   duration_ms: 3.62153\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9823197Z   type: 'test'\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9823450Z   ...\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9823953Z # Subtest: raw whitespace counts toward the same value-byte limit in both editors\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9824729Z ok 243 - raw whitespace counts toward the same value-byte limit in both editors\\n2026-10-29T07:23:03.9825231Z   ---\"]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"86c3ef\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000012125,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":4683,\"output\":\"import {Injectable,signal} from '@angular/core';\\nimport type {OriginalAccessSet,OriginalWorkChallenge} from '@testcenter-rewrite-app/contracts/original-session';\\nexport class NativeMonitorHttpError extends Error {constructor(readonly status:number,message:string){super(message);}}\\nconst key='testcenter-native-monitor-session';\\n@Injectable({providedIn:'root'})\\nexport class NativeMonitorSessionService {\\n readonly access=signal<OriginalAccessSet|null>(null);\\n readonly busy=signal(false);\\n readonly restoring=signal(false);\\n private revision=0;\\n private accessController=new AbortController();\\n get accessSignal():AbortSignal{return this.accessController.signal;}\\n private renewAccessScope(){this.accessController.abort();this.accessController=new AbortController();}\\n readonly problem=signal('');\\n constructor(){try{const token=localStorage.getItem(key);if(token)void this.restore(token);}catch{}}\\n private async restore(token:string){\\n  const revision=this.revision;this.restoring.set(true);\\n  try{const access=await this.json<OriginalAccessSet>('GET','/session',undefined,token);if(revision===this.revision)this.set(access);}\\n  catch{if(revision===this.revision)this.clear();}\\n  finally{if(revision===this.revision)this.restoring.set(false);}\\n }\\n async login(name:string,REDACTED:string):Promise<OriginalAccessSet>{\\n  this.renewAccessScope();const revision=++this.revision;this.restoring.set(false);this.busy.set(true);this.problem.set('');\\n  try{\\n   if(REDACTED&&!globalThis.isSecureContext)throw new Error('Die Anmeldung ist nur über eine verschlüsselte Verbindung (HTTPS) möglich.');\\n   let access:OriginalAccessSet;\\n   try{access=await this.json('PUT','/session/login',{name,REDACTED},'');}\\n   catch(error){if(!(error instanceof NativeMonitorHttpError)||error.status!==400||!error.message.includes('Brute Force protection active'))throw error;\\n    const challenge=await this.json<OriginalWorkChallenge&{maxnumber?:number}>('POST','/session/challenge',{loginType:'login',name,REDACTED},'');\\n    const {solveChallengeWorkers}=await import('altcha-lib');\\n    const solved=await solveChallengeWorkers(new URL('altcha-lib/dist/worker.js',document.baseURI).toString(),Math.max(1,Math.min(8,navigator.hardwareConcurrency??4)),challenge.challenge,challenge.salt,challenge.algorithm,challenge.maxNumber??challenge.maxnumber??1_000_000);\\n    if(!solved)throw new Error('Die Sicherheitsprüfung konnte nicht abgeschlossen werden.');\\n    access=await this.json('PUT','/session',{algorithm:challenge.algorithm,salt:challenge.salt,challenge:challenge.challenge,signature:challenge.signature,number:solved.number},'');\\n   }\\n   if(!access.claims.testGroupMonitor?.length){if(access.token)await this.text('DELETE','/session',undefined,access.token);throw new Error('Dieser Zugang hat keine Berechtigung für den Gruppenmonitor.');}\\n   if(revision!==this.revision){await this.text('DELETE','/session',undefined,access.token);throw new Error('Die Anmeldung wurde abgebrochen.');}\\n   this.set(access);return access;\\n  }catch(error){this.problem.set(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Problem bei der Anmeldung.');throw error;}finally{if(revision===this.revision)this.busy.set(false);}\\n }\\n async refresh(){const token=this.access()?.token,revision=this.revision;if(token){const access=await this.json<OriginalAccessSet>('GET','/session',undefined,token);if(revision===this.revision)this.set(access);}}\\n async logout(){const token=this.access()?.token;this.clear();if(token)await this.text('DELETE','/session',undefined,token);}\\n private set(access:OriginalAccessSet){if(!access.token||!access.claims?.testGroupMonitor?.length){this.clear();throw new Error('Dieser Zugang hat keine Berechtigung für den Gruppenmonitor.');}this.renewAccessScope();this.access.set(access);try{localStorage.setItem(key,access.token);}catch{}}\\n clear(){this.renewAccessScope();this.revision++;this.restoring.set(false);this.busy.set(false);this.access.set(null);try{localStorage.removeItem(key);}catch{}}\\n async text(method:string,path:string,body?:unknown,token=this.access()?.token??'',rawBody=false,signal?:AbortSignal):Promise<string>{\\n  const scope=token&&token===this.access()?.token?this.accessSignal:undefined;\\n  const signals=[AbortSignal.timeout(20000),...(signal?[signal]:[]),...(scope?[scope]:[])];\\n  const response=await fetch(path,{method,headers:{Accept:'application/json',...(token?{AuthToken:token}:{}),...(body===undefined?{}:{'Content-Type':'application/json'})},...(body===undefined?{}:{body:rawBody?String(body):JSON.stringify(body)}),signal:AbortSignal.any(signals),cache:'no-store'});\\n  const text=await response.text();scope?.throwIfAborted();if(!response.ok){\\n   if([401,403].includes(response.status)&&token&&token===this.access()?.token)this.clear();\\n   throw new NativeMonitorHttpError(response.status,token?text.replaceAll(token,'[redacted]'):text);\\n  }return text;\\n }\\n async json<T>(method:string,path:string,body?:unknown,token=this.access()?.token??''):Promise<T>{return JSON.parse(await this.text(method,path,body,token)) as T;}\\n}\\nimport { inject, Injectable } from '@angular/core';\\nimport {\\n  BehaviorSubject, combineLatest, defer, EMPTY, fromEvent, interval, Observable, of, Subject, Subscription, zip\\n} from 'rxjs';\\nimport type { Sort } from '@angular/material/sort';\\nimport {\\n  delay, filter, mergeMap, map, startWith, switchMap, take, takeUntil, tap\\n} from 'rxjs/operators';\\nimport { BackendService } from '../backend.service';\\nimport { BookletService } from '../booklet/booklet.service';\\nimport { TestSessionUtil } from '../test-session/test-session.util';\\nimport {\\n  type CheckingOptions,\\n  type CommandResponse,\\n  type GotoCommandData,\\n  type GroupMonitorConfig,\\n  isBooklet,\\n  type Selected,\\n  type Testlet,\\n  type TestSession,\\n  type TestSessionFilter,\\n  type TestSessionFilterList,\\n  type TestSessionSetStat,\\n  TestSessionsSuperStates\\n} from '../group-monitor.interfaces';\\nimport { BookletUtil } from '../booklet/booklet.util';\\nimport { GROUP_MONITOR_CONFIG } from '../group-monitor.config';\\nimport type { TestSessionByDataTestId } from './test-session-manager.interfaces';\\n\\n@Injectable()\\nexport class TestSessionManager {\\n  private readonly groupMonitorConfig=inject(GROUP_MONITOR_CONFIG);\\n  static readonly basicFilters: TestSessionFilterList = {\\n    locked: {\\n      selected: false,\\n      source: 'base',\\n      filter: {\\n        id: 'locked',\\n        label: 'gm_filter_locked',\\n        target: 'testState',\\n        value: 'status',\\n        subValue: 'locked',\\n        type: 'equal',\\n        not: false\\n      }\\n    },\\n    pending: {\\n      selected: false,\\n      source: 'base',\\n      filter: {\\n        id: 'pending',\\n        label: 'gm_filter_pending',\\n        target: 'testState',\\n        value: 'status',\\n        subValue: 'pending',\\n        type: 'equal',\\n        not: false\\n      }\\n    },\\n    quick: {\\n      selected: false,\\n      source: 'quick',\\n      filter: {\\n        id: 'quickFilter',\\n        label: 'gm_filter_quick',\\n        target: 'personLabel',\\n        value: '',\\n        subValue: '',\\n        type: 'substring',\\n        not: true\\n      }\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  sortBy$: Subject<Sort>;\\n  filters$: Subject<TestSessionFilter[]>;\\n  filterOptions: TestSessionFilterList = {};\\n  checkingOptions: CheckingOptions = {\\n    enableAutoCheckAll: false,\\n    autoCheckAll: false\\n  };\\n\\n  private groupName: string = '';\\n  private connectionRevision = 0;\\n  private readonly disconnected$ = new Subject<void>();\\n  private monitor$: Observable<TestSession[]> = new Observable<TestSession[]>();\\n  private _sessions$: BehaviorSubject<TestSession[]> = new BehaviorSubject<TestSession[]>([]);\\n  private _checked: { [sessionTestSessionId: string]: TestSession } = {};\\n  private _checkedStats$: BehaviorSubject<TestSessionSetStat>;\\n  private _sessionsStats$: BehaviorSubject<TestSessionSetStat>;\\n  private _commandResponses$: Subject<CommandResponse> = new Subject<CommandResponse>();\\n  private _clock$: Observable<number>;\\n  private monitorSubscription: Subscription | null = null;\\n\\n  constructor(\\n    private bs: BackendService,\\n    private bookletService: BookletService,\\n  ) {\\n    this._checkedStats$ = new BehaviorSubject<TestSessionSetStat>(TestSessionManager.getEmptyStats());\\n    this._sessionsStats$ = new BehaviorSubject<TestSessionSetStat>(TestSessionManager.getEmptyStats());\\n    this.sortBy$ = new BehaviorSubject<Sort>({ direction: 'asc', active: 'personLabel' });\\n    this.filters$ = new BehaviorSubject<TestSessionFilter[]>([]);\\n    this._clock$ = this.groupMonitorConfig.checkForIdleInterval ?\\n      interval(this.groupMonitorConfig.checkForIdleInterval).pipe(startWith(0)) :\\n      of(0);\\n    this.resetFilters();\\n  }\\n\\n  get sessions$(): Observable<TestSession[]> {\\n    return this._sessions$.asObservable();\\n  }\\n\\n  get sessions(): TestSession[] {\\n    return this._sessions$.getValue();\\n  }\\n\\n  get checked(): TestSession[] { // this is intentionally not an observable\\n    return Object.values(this._checked);\\n  }\\n\\n  get sessionsStats$(): Observable<TestSessionSetStat> {\\n    return this._sessionsStats$.asObservable();\\n  }\\n\\n  get checkedStats$(): Observable<TestSessionSetStat> {\\n    return this._checkedStats$.asObservable();\\n  }\\n\\n  get commandResponses$(): Observable<CommandResponse> {\\n    return this._commandResponses$\\n      .pipe(\\n        filter(c => !!c)\\n      );\\n  }\\n\\n  connect(groupName: string): void {\\n    this.disconnect();\\n    this.groupName = groupName;\\n    this.sortBy$.next({ direction: 'asc', active: 'personLabel' });\\n    this.filters$.next([]);\\n    this.checkingOptions = {\\n      enableAutoCheckAll: true,\\n      autoCheckAll: true\\n    };\\n\\n    this._checkedStats$.next(TestSessionManager.getEmptyStats());\\n    this._sessionsStats$.next(TestSessionManager.getEmptyStats());\\n    // this._commandResponses$.next();\\n\\n    this.monitor$ = this.bs.observeSessionsMonitor(groupName)\\n      .pipe(\\n        switchMap(sessionChanges => sessionChanges.length ? zip(\\n          ...sessionChanges\\n            .map(sessionChange => combineLatest([\\n              this.bookletService.getBooklet(sessionChange.bookletName),\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:5:await import('@angular/compiler');\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:7:let code=ts.transpileModule(await readFile(path,'utf8'),{compilerOptions:{target:ts.ScriptTarget.ES2022,module:ts.ModuleKind.ES2022,experimentalDecorators:true}}).outputText;\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:16:test('late native restoration cannot replace a newer real login',()=>fixture(async values=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:18: await session.login('owned','REDACTED');pending.resolve(response(access('old')));await settle();assert.equal(session.access().token,'new');assert.equal(values.get(storageKey),'new');assert.equal(session.restoring(),false);\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:19: const login=requests.find(r=>r.options.method==='PUT');assert.equal(login.options.headers.AuthToken,undefined);assert.equal(login.options.headers.Authorization,undefined);assert.equal(login.options.cache,'no-store');assert.deepEqual(JSON.parse(login.options.body),{name:'owned',REDACTED:'REDACTED'});\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:21:test('logout prevents a late restoring request from bringing a native session back',()=>fixture(async values=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:22: const pending=deferred();globalThis.fetch=()=>pending.promise;const session=new NativeMonitorSessionService();await session.logout();pending.resolve(response(access('old')));await settle();assert.equal(session.access(),null);assert.equal(values.has(storageKey),false);\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:25: let handler=()=>response(access('current'));globalThis.fetch=(path,options)=>handler(path,options);const session=new NativeMonitorSessionService();await session.login('owned','REDACTED');\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:27: handler=()=>response(access('replacement'));await session.login('owned','REDACTED');handler=()=>response('revoked old',401);await assert.rejects(session.text('GET','/session',undefined,'old'));assert.equal(session.access().token,'replacement');\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:29:test('restored claims must still authorize the monitor and insecure REDACTED entry sends no request',()=>fixture(async values=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:31: globalThis.isSecureContext=false;let called=false;globalThis.fetch=async()=>{called=true;throw Error('Unexpected request');};await assert.rejects(session.login('owned','REDACTED'),/HTTPS/);assert.equal(called,false);assert.equal(session.busy(),false);\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:34: globalThis.fetch=async()=>response(access('current'));const session=new NativeMonitorSessionService();await session.login('owned','REDACTED');const controller=new AbortController();let received;\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:38: globalThis.fetch=async()=>response(access('current'));const session=new NativeMonitorSessionService();await session.login('owned','REDACTED');\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:43:test('starting a replacement login invalidates pending actions from the old access',()=>fixture(async()=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:44: globalThis.fetch=async()=>response(access('current'));const session=new NativeMonitorSessionService();await session.login('owned','REDACTED');const old=session.accessSignal;\\nscripts/native-monitor-session.test.mjs:45: globalThis.fetch=async()=>response(access('replacement'));await session.login('replacement','REDACTED');assert.equal(old.aborted,true);assert.notEqual(session.accessSignal,old);assert.equal(session.access().token,'replacement');\\nscripts/native-monitor-views.test.mjs:5:await import('@angular/compiler');\\nscripts/native-monitor-views.test.mjs:8:const load=async path=>{let s=await readFile(new URL('../apps/web/src/app/native-monitor/'+path,import.meta.url),'utf8');const code=ts.transpileModule(s,{compilerOptions:{target:ts.ScriptTarget.ES2022,module:ts.ModuleKind.ES2022}}).outputText;return import('data:text/javascript;base64,'+Buffer.from(code).toString('base64'));};\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:25: const code=ts.transpileModule(source,{compilerOptions:{target:ts.ScriptTarget.ES2022,module:ts.ModuleKind.CommonJS,experimentalDecorators:true}}).outputText;\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:61: const params=new rx.Subject(),profiles=new Map(),connected=[],navigated=[],confirmations=new rx.Subject(),gotoDialog=new rx.Subject(),gotos=[];let finishes=0,dialogRenders=0;\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:64: const tsm={checked:[],getMaxTimeAcrossAllSessions:()=>10,testCommandGoto(selection,time,targets){gotos.push({selection,time,targets});return rx.of(true);},sessions$:new rx.BehaviorSubject([]),sessionsStats$:new rx.BehaviorSubject(empty()),checkedStats$:new rx.BehaviorSubject(empty()),commandResponses$:new rx.Subject(),checkingOptions:{enableAutoCheckAll:true},filterOptions:{},connect(group){connected.push(group);},disconnect(){},resetFilters(){this.filterOptions={quick:{selected:false,filter:{value:''}}};},refreshFilters(){},commandFinishEverything(){finishes++;return rx.of({commandType:'terminate',testIds:['1']});}};\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:69: return {component,params,profiles,connected,navigated,confirmations,controller,tsm,gotoDialog,gotos,filterDialog,filterOpen,get dialogRenders(){return dialogRenders;},get filterCloses(){return filterCloses;},get finishes(){return finishes;}};\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:102:test('finish-all captures original int64 targets before later lock snapshots',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:108:for(const transition of ['group','access','disconnect'])test('finish-all cannot continue after '+transition+' transition',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:113:test('a finish observable created for a retired group cannot start a lock on later subscription',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:126:test('finish returns to the actual native chooser after the existing delay',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:127: clock(t);const f=componentFixture();f.params.next({'group-name':'A'});f.component.finishEverythingCommand();f.confirmations.next(true);t.mock.timers.tick(1999);assert.deepEqual(f.navigated,[]);t.mock.timers.tick(1);assert.deepEqual(f.navigated,['/group-monitor']);assert.equal(f.component.isClosing,false);f.component.ngOnDestroy();\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:129:for(const phase of ['confirmation','navigation'])test('route change cancels stale finish '+phase,t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:130: clock(t);const f=componentFixture();f.params.next({'group-name':'A'});f.component.finishEverythingCommand();if(phase==='navigation')f.confirmations.next(true);f.params.next({'group-name':'B'});if(phase==='confirmation')f.confirmations.next(true);t.mock.timers.tick(3000);assert.deepEqual(f.navigated,[]);assert.equal(f.finishes,phase==='confirmation'?0:1);assert.equal(f.component.isClosing,false);f.component.ngOnDestroy();\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:150:test('a Booklet read survives repeated snapshots, but an unfinished replacement aborts and retries after disconnect',async t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:178:test('finish locks materialized pending tests but never sends terminate to pending or nonpositive IDs',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:235:const finishPacket=(id,state={})=>({testId:id,groupName:'A',personLabel:id,bookletName:'BOOK',timestamp:1,testState:{CONTROLLER:'RUNNING',CONNECTION:'POLLING',...state}});\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:236:test('finish before first render waits for a fresh complete snapshot and uses its exact int64 targets',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:239: fresh.next([finishPacket('9007199254740993'),finishPacket('9007199254740994',{status:'pending'}),finishPacket('0',{status:'pending'})]);\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:243:test('finish gets current native targets independently of stale rendered material',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:245: f.backend.getSessionsMonitor=()=>rx.of([finishPacket('9007199254740994')]);f.manager.commandFinishEverything().subscribe();\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:248:test('a failed finish snapshot never writes stale targets or reports successful completion',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:252:for(const transition of ['group','access','disconnect'])test('finish pending snapshot cannot outlive '+transition+' context',t=>{\\nscripts/native-monitor-lifecycle.test.mjs:255: assert.equal(fresh.observed,false);fresh.next([finishPacket('9007199254740993')]);t.mock.timers.tick(2000);assert.deepEqual(f.writes,[]);f.manager.disconnect();\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18695-87cd-7aa0-b257-6c7fc577e31f","create_time":1793259361.189391}},"metadata":{"client_